_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 93/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1409/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 96/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1885/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.022      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    7.022      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13470:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230915 and revision id 100373. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}